OL,3,GNEWSAHull City player crashes near
OL,4,Atraining ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Premier League player has been
OL,7,Finvolved in a car crash near Hull
OL,8,FCity's training ground weeks after a
OL,9,Fsimilar incident involving his
OL,10,Fteammate.
OL,12,FA black Mercedes, which the BBC
OL,13,Funderstands belongs to midfielder Lucas
OL,14,FGourna-Douath, 24, crashed on Millhouse
OL,15,FWoods Lane in Cottingham, East
OL,16,FYorkshire.
OL,18,FPictures of the scene show the car on
OL,19,Fits side. One resident told the BBC
OL,20,Fthat the vehicle had also struck and
OL,21,Fdamaged her car.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
