OL,3,GNEWSAHull City player crashes near
OL,4,Atraining ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull City said the club was "aware of
OL,7,Fimages circulating on social media
OL,8,Ffollowing a road traffic accident near
OL,9,Fthe training ground and can confirm
OL,10,Fthat no one was harmed in the
OL,11,Fincident".
